{
  "id": "xipe-boilerplate",
  "name": "Xipe Boilerplate",
  "description": "Full-stack boilerplate with JWT Auth, Multi-tenant support (Tenant/User), SQLite/SqlServer switch, and Blazor frontend with Login/Register/Dashboard/Profile.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "framework": "net9.0",
  "projects": [
    {
      "name": "Domain",
      "suffix": ".Domain",
      "type": "classlib",
      "sdk": null,
      "references": [],
      "nugets": [],
      "folders": [
        "Entities",
        "Interfaces",
        "DTOs"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "Entities/BaseEntity.cs",
          "template": "XipeBaseEntity"
        },
        {
          "path": "Entities/Tenant.cs",
          "template": "XipeTenant"
        },
        {
          "path": "Entities/User.cs",
          "template": "XipeUser"
        },
        {
          "path": "DTOs/AuthDtos.cs",
          "template": "XipeAuthDtos"
        },
        {
          "path": "Interfaces/IAuthService.cs",
          "template": "XipeIAuthService"
        }
      ],
      "cleanup": null,
      "systemPrompt": "## Project: {SolutionName}.Domain\n\nDomain layer with base entities and interfaces.\n\n**Key Files:**\n- \u0060Entities/BaseEntity.cs\u0060 - Base class with Id, CreatedAt, TenantId\n- \u0060Entities/Tenant.cs\u0060 - Multi-tenant root entity\n- \u0060Entities/User.cs\u0060 - User entity with Email, PasswordHash\n- \u0060DTOs/AuthDtos.cs\u0060 - Login, Register, Token DTOs\n- \u0060Interfaces/IAuthService.cs\u0060 - Auth service interface"
    },
    {
      "name": "Api",
      "suffix": ".Api",
      "type": "webapi",
      "sdk": null,
      "references": [
        "Domain"
      ],
      "nugets": [
        {
          "name": "Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore",
          "version": "9.0.12"
        },
        {
          "name": "Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite",
          "version": "9.0.12"
        },
        {
          "name": "Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer",
          "version": "9.0.12"
        },
        {
          "name": "Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design",
          "version": "9.0.12"
        },
        {
          "name": "Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer",
          "version": "9.0.12"
        },
        {
          "name": "Swashbuckle.AspNetCore",
          "version": "7.2.0"
        },
        {
          "name": "BCrypt.Net-Next",
          "version": "4.0.3"
        }
      ],
      "folders": [
        "Data",
        "Services",
        "Controllers",
        "Properties"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "Data/AppDbContext.cs",
          "template": "XipeDbContext"
        },
        {
          "path": "Data/AppSeeder.cs",
          "template": "XipeSeeder"
        },
        {
          "path": "Services/AuthService.cs",
          "template": "XipeAuthService"
        },
        {
          "path": "Controllers/AuthController.cs",
          "template": "XipeAuthController"
        },
        {
          "path": "Program.cs",
          "template": "XipeProgramApi"
        },
        {
          "path": "appsettings.json",
          "template": "XipeAppSettings"
        },
        {
          "path": "Properties/launchSettings.json",
          "template": "XipeLaunchSettings"
        }
      ],
      "cleanup": null,
      "systemPrompt": "## Project: {SolutionName}.Api\n\nASP.NET Core Web API with JWT authentication.\n\n**Key Files:**\n- \u0060Data/AppDbContext.cs\u0060 - EF Core DbContext with SQLite/SqlServer switch\n- \u0060Services/AuthService.cs\u0060 - JWT token generation and validation\n- \u0060Controllers/AuthController.cs\u0060 - Login, Register, Logout, RefreshToken, ForgotPassword\n- \u0060Program.cs\u0060 - Configured with JWT auth and database provider switch\n- \u0060appsettings.json\u0060 - Database configuration with Provider selector"
    },
    {
      "name": "Web",
      "suffix": ".Web",
      "type": "blazor",
      "sdk": null,
      "references": [
        "Domain"
      ],
      "nugets": [
        {
          "name": "Blazored.LocalStorage",
          "version": "4.5.0"
        },
        {
          "name": "Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Authorization",
          "version": "9.0.12"
        },
        {
          "name": "System.IdentityModel.Tokens.Jwt",
          "version": "7.0.3"
        },
        {
          "name": "MudBlazor",
          "version": "8.15.0"
        }
      ],
      "folders": [
        "Services",
        "Components/Pages/Auth",
        "Components/Layout",
        "Properties",
        "wwwroot",
        "wwwroot/css"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "Program.cs",
          "template": "XipeBlazorProgram"
        },
        {
          "path": "wwwroot/index.html",
          "template": "XipeBlazorIndex"
        },
        {
          "path": "wwwroot/css/app.css",
          "template": "XipeBlazorAppCss"
        },
        {
          "path": "wwwroot/appsettings.json",
          "template": "XipeBlazorAppSettings"
        },
        {
          "path": "Properties/launchSettings.json",
          "template": "XipeBlazorLaunchSettings"
        },
        {
          "path": "Services/ApiService.cs",
          "template": "XipeBlazorApiService"
        },
        {
          "path": "Services/AuthStateProvider.cs",
          "template": "XipeBlazorAuthState"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/_Imports.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorImports"
        },
        {
          "path": "App.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorApp"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Routes.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorRoutes"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/RedirectToLogin.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorRedirectToLogin"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Layout/MainLayout.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorMainLayout"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Pages/Home.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorHome"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Pages/Auth/Login.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorLoginPage"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Pages/Auth/Register.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorRegisterPage"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Pages/Dashboard.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorDashboard"
        },
        {
          "path": "Components/Pages/Profile.razor",
          "template": "XipeBlazorProfile"
        }
      ],
      "cleanup": [
        "Pages"
      ],
      "systemPrompt": "## Project: {SolutionName}.Web\n\nBlazor WebAssembly frontend.\n\n**Key Files:**\n- \u0060Services/ApiService.cs\u0060 - HTTP client for API calls\n- \u0060Services/AuthStateProvider.cs\u0060 - JWT token management\n- \u0060Components/Layout/MainLayout.razor\u0060 - Top bar layout\n- \u0060Components/Pages/Auth/Login.razor\u0060 - Login page\n- \u0060Components/Pages/Auth/Register.razor\u0060 - Register page\n- \u0060Components/Pages/Dashboard.razor\u0060 - Dashboard\n- \u0060Components/Pages/Profile.razor\u0060 - User profile"
    }
  ],
  "baseEntities": [
    {
      "name": "Tenant",
      "inherits": null,
      "isAbstract": false,
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "Name",
          "type": "string",
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Slug",
          "type": "string",
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "IsActive",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "true"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User",
      "inherits": null,
      "isAbstract": false,
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "Email",
          "type": "string",
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "PasswordHash",
          "type": "string",
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Role",
          "type": "string",
          "default": "\u0022User\u0022"
        },
        {
          "name": "IsActive",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "RefreshToken",
          "type": "string?",
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "RefreshTokenExpiry",
          "type": "DateTime?",
          "default": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "diana": {
    "folders": {
      "entities": "{SolutionName}.Domain/Entities",
      "dtos": "{SolutionName}.Domain/DTOs",
      "services": "{SolutionName}.Api/Services",
      "controllers": "{SolutionName}.Api/Controllers"
    },
    "templates": null
  },
  "documentation": null,
  "systemPrompt": "You are working on **{SolutionName}**, a multi-tenant application with JWT authentication.\n\n## Architecture: Xipe Boilerplate\n\n| Project | Type | Purpose |\n|---------|------|------|\n| {SolutionName}.Domain | Class Library | Entities, DTOs, Interfaces |\n| {SolutionName}.Api | Web API | REST API with JWT Auth |\n| {SolutionName}.Web | Blazor | Frontend SPA |\n\n## Database Configuration\nEdit \u0060appsettings.json\u0060 to switch between SQLite and SqlServer:\n\u0060\u0060\u0060json\n\u0022Database\u0022: {\n  \u0022Provider\u0022: \u0022SQLite\u0022,  // or \u0022SqlServer\u0022\n  \u0022Default\u0022: \u0022SQLite\u0022\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n## Base Entities\n- **Tenant** - Root entity for multi-tenancy\n- **User** - User with Email/Password, linked to Tenant\n\n## Auth Endpoints\n- POST \u0060/api/auth/login\u0060 - Login\n- POST \u0060/api/auth/register\u0060 - Register\n- POST \u0060/api/auth/logout\u0060 - Logout\n- POST \u0060/api/auth/refresh\u0060 - Refresh token\n- POST \u0060/api/auth/forgot-password\u0060 - Forgot password",
  "folders": {
    "entities": "{SolutionName}.Domain/Entities",
    "dtos": "{SolutionName}.Domain/DTOs",
    "services": "{SolutionName}.Api/Services",
    "controllers": "{SolutionName}.Api/Controllers"
  }
}